        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds the documentation and release note for the addition of the <code class=\"notranslate\">browser_action.onUserSettingsChanged</code> event.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1828220\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1828220</a><br>\nImplement onUserSettingsChanged event.</p>",
